---
import Layout from "@layout/Default.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import photo from "../assets/images/team/photo.jpg";

---

<Layout>
	<main>
		<section class="l-section">
			<div class="l-container l-grid" style="margin-top: 50px">
				<div class="c-section__left l-grid__column--6">
					<section>
						<p>Independent Arts is building the infrastructure for sustainable creative production.</p>

						<p>We work with creators to move ideas from concept to production—through projects, spaces, and systems that make creative work viable over time.</p>

						<p>Our work sits at the intersection of culture and economics. We design and test models that allow creative practices to generate consistent output, income, and audience.</p>

						<p>Since 2021, we've collaborated on projects across film, comics, archives, and digital media—each one a step towards understanding what it takes to sustain creative work at scale.</p>

						<p>
							Today, that work extends beyond projects into building the environments that support them:
							<br />
							spaces, tools, and programmes that turn creative energy into production.
						</p>
					</section>
				</div>
				<aside class="c-section__right l-grid__column-start--8 l-grid__column--5">
					<div class="c-section">
						<figure>
							<Image src={photo} width={512} height={341} alt="Independent Arts Logo" />
						</figure>
					</div>
				</aside>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>
